[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12910.469, "timestamp": "03:35:10", "text": "日本有了很多新的體會。  她教了我貨幣的運作方式以及人們如何購物。就像那是她喜歡的東西。  她說，你可以直接從像7-11這樣的便利商店買"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12924.55, "timestamp": "03:35:24", "text": "食物，然後在那裡吃。我當時就懵了？  她說：「是啊，他們那裡有熱水，還有微波爐。」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12936.269, "timestamp": "03:35:36", "text": "[音樂] 很有趣。  是的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12941.269, "timestamp": "03:35:41", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "his model too!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12941.79, "timestamp": "03:35:41", "text": "。我覺得一年後或幾個月後，我也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12951.07, "timestamp": "03:35:51", "text": "我覺得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12953.59, "timestamp": "03:35:53", "text": "我對日本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12955.19, "timestamp": "03:35:55", "text": "以及日本的生活等等都非常了解。"}]